# Runtime state — must come from GCS / the VM bind-mount, never the
# image. Baking signal_book.json into the Cloud Run image meant
# `_read_text_any` found a stale local copy first and never queried
# GCS, so the dashboard kept serving 7 zombie READY signals from an
# April backfill weeks after they should have expired. Reference data
# in data_store/ (ohlcv, intraday, indices) is still bundled because
# the bind-mount seeding step in vm_redeploy.sh depends on it.
data_store/signal_book.json
data_store/signal_book.json.bak
data_store/signal_history.jsonl

